{"id":"n31674-3-10","stage":0,"title":"그릇 · 碗","scene":"餐饮与生活","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n31674-3-10-1","ko":"여기요. 자장면 한 그릇 주세요.","zh":"服务员，请来一碗炸酱面。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"여기요.","meaning":"这里，这儿","explanation":"여기：这里，这儿；요：增加礼貌语气。","readings":[{"term":"여기","audio":"/audio/c13089162f79c61744a9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17863","senseId":"1","lemma":"여기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"자장면","meaning":"韩式炸酱面","explanation":"자장면：韩式炸酱面","readings":[{"term":"자장면","audio":"/audio/11a41c91582062e1f6ec.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"23362","senseId":"1","lemma":"자장면","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"한","meaning":"一","explanation":"한：一","readings":[{"term":"한","audio":"/audio/89233692031a62c60e6e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73278","senseId":"1","lemma":"한","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"그릇","meaning":"碗","explanation":"그릇：碗","readings":[{"term":"그릇","audio":"/audio/7e60f5c15633cdc1f60c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"31674","senseId":"3","lemma":"그릇","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"주세요.","meaning":"给予，给","explanation":"주다：给予，给；세요：包含尊敬形式的礼貌句末，可表示请求、劝告或询问等。","readings":[{"term":"주다","audio":"/audio/1b43f195318e9604abd7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"82136","senseId":"1","lemma":"주다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"c13089162f79c617","term":"여기","zh":"这里，这儿","audio":"/audio/c13089162f79c61744a9.mp3","entryId":"17863","definition":"指代与说话人较近的地方。","pronunciation":["여기"]},{"id":"11a41c91582062e1","term":"자장면","zh":"韩式炸酱面","audio":"/audio/11a41c91582062e1f6ec.mp3","entryId":"23362","definition":"将肉类、蔬菜等食材伴着春酱炒成调料酱，再浇在面条上拌着吃的食物。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"89233692031a62c6","term":"한","zh":"一","audio":"/audio/89233692031a62c60e6e.mp3","entryId":"73278","definition":"一个的。","pronunciation":["한"]},{"id":"7e60f5c15633cdc1","term":"그릇","zh":"碗","audio":"/audio/7e60f5c15633cdc1f60c.mp3","entryId":"31674","definition":"数盛在餐具里的食物的数量单位。","pronunciation":["그륻"]},{"id":"1b43f195318e9604","term":"주다","zh":"给予，给","audio":"/audio/1b43f195318e9604abd7.mp3","entryId":"82136","definition":"把东西等递给别人，让别人拥有或使用。","pronunciation":["주다"]}],"audio":"/audio/52e3b01020809b1e8a2c.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n31674-3-10-2","ko":"네, 알겠습니다. 잠시만 기다려 주세요.","zh":"好的，请稍等。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"네,","meaning":"是，是的，哎","explanation":"네：是，是的，哎","readings":[{"term":"네","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17294","senseId":"1","lemma":"네","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"알겠습니다.","meaning":"懂，明白","explanation":"알다：懂，明白；겠：表示意愿、推测或礼貌委婉，结合整句判断。；습니다：正式礼貌的陈述句末。","readings":[{"term":"알다","audio":"/audio/4646a3463436c8a43feb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89445","senseId":"9","lemma":"알다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"잠시만","meaning":"片刻，暂时","explanation":"잠시：片刻，暂时；만：表示“只、仅”。","readings":[{"term":"잠시","audio":"/audio/6fcdfa8c124ab5cbb197.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71203","senseId":"1","lemma":"잠시","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"기다려","meaning":"等，等待","explanation":"기다리다：等，等待；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"기다리다","audio":"/audio/1f9765247406d52d5aaa.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62264","senseId":"1","lemma":"기다리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"주세요.","meaning":"为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）","explanation":"주다：为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）；세요：包含尊敬形式的礼貌句末，可表示请求、劝告或询问等。","readings":[{"term":"주다","audio":"/audio/1b43f195318e9604abd7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"77245","senseId":"1","lemma":"주다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"1c0ddfd005093840","term":"네","zh":"是，是的，哎","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3","entryId":"17294","definition":"用于回应长辈的呼叫。","pronunciation":["네"]},{"id":"4646a3463436c8a4","term":"알다","zh":"懂，明白","audio":"/audio/4646a3463436c8a43feb.mp3","entryId":"89445","definition":"对于对方的某个命令或请求，同意听从。","pronunciation":["알ː다"]},{"id":"6fcdfa8c124ab5cb","term":"잠시","zh":"片刻，暂时","audio":"/audio/6fcdfa8c124ab5cbb197.mp3","entryId":"71203","definition":"一小会儿。","pronunciation":["잠ː시"]},{"id":"1f9765247406d52d","term":"기다리다","zh":"等，等待","audio":"/audio/1f9765247406d52d5aaa.mp3","entryId":"62264","definition":"直到人、时机到来或某事完成为止，一直打发时间。","pronunciation":["기다리다"]},{"id":"1b43f195318e9604","term":"주다","zh":"为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）","audio":"/audio/1b43f195318e9604abd7.mp3","entryId":"77245","definition":"为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）","pronunciation":["주다"]}],"audio":"/audio/38aa498b9792ab17cf49.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":1.58,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=31674","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"3","sourceLevel":"초급","day":27,"sequenceScore":1.1776,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["服务员，请来一碗炸酱面。","好的，请稍等。","不好意思，请问您多大年纪呢？"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["服务员，请来一碗炸酱面。","好的，请稍等。","不好意思，请问您多大年纪呢？"],"answer":1}]}
